  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-h7hTV0YC\">本章介绍通过Marketing API可操作的本地推投放能力，新版本账户结构升级为【项目】、【营销】、【素材】</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-h2X6Tc9Y\" id=\"h346b9f0-h2X6Tc9Y\">开发者应用创建</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-O3IOZw4a\">应用根据业务场景分为【巨量营销】和【巨量千川】，不同业务场景对应接入能力范围不同，每个业务场景下最多可创建10个应用。</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VTxUj%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-qtTUEy1V%5C%22%3E%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E6%8E%A8%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E3%80%90%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E3%80%91%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E3%80%90%E4%BB%85%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8APC%E7%89%88%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qtTUEy1V\">本地推业务属于巨量营销业务线下，所以需要创建【巨量营销】类型应用，接入能力范围选择【仅巨量营销PC版】</p></div></div></div><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-Pa1mEEMQ\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-T80zn1k5\"><strong>不同应用场景对应支持权限范围不同，可参考图表 2-1</strong></p></blockquote><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t19da54e-TDFJ2PFm\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-imneDH4O\"><col data-id=\"cdb83bf8-6e43FS4d\" span=\"1\" width=\"12.059158134243459%\"/><col data-id=\"c8051aef-3HagMgM8\" span=\"1\" width=\"15.927189988623436%\"/><col data-id=\"ca1b81d0-PR83SNhY\" span=\"1\" width=\"19.453924914675767%\"/><col data-id=\"cfd787b5-25QMKhNY\" span=\"1\" width=\"52.55972696245734%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-jiRH5Toa\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-lTMbLld5\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t6267798-J3NZdQJC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aC3dGLgS\">类型<br/></p></td><td data-id=\"t6267798-V6EZMOV5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rFyQSQZS\">应用场景<br/></p></td><td data-id=\"t6267798-47LYDkd7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vC1NGxwt\">客户类型/产品形态<br/></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t6267798-PePZCWZ5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fZHsCz6P\">应用权限范围<br/></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-R9iAA7mT\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tefa6ee1-jC823dOD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qgMNNMZG\">基础应用</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tefa6ee1-1Sn4SNbU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WfM6gsdd\">自研投放系统</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-ibSYKO2B\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wj32aQVU\">客户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-A1KDim9d\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-y0JcaziC\">除【代理商账号管理】类接口</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-0NQiWSf5\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-hS057kW5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cSFBEV07\">代理商客户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-1jj23leo\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ES22KBFb\">除【旧版巨量引擎工作台管理】类接口</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-IgHi0OKj\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tefa6ee1-oaKXBfUU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HjDcKkdh\">服务市场应用</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tefa6ee1-1QLpBlcC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-30J2aloX\">提供第三方服务</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-igElhCl4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JCUol0SK\">三方服务站点</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-1HV44O74\"><br/></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-cBQrMr2H\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S0VVZSZz\">除【客户信息与资质管理(除\"客户公开信息\"接口)】、【代理商账号管理-创建和修改客户】、【代理商账号管理-资金和流水管理】类接口</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-4nq4WYfc\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-M3F9KmSJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JlVkmUXa\">群峰上架服务</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-05QrHm0o\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jIwlHrpU\"><br/></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-S9TF08dA\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"4\" data-id=\"tcddc681-WWCchBb8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-IldmYb70\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>图表 2-1</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-HtNpLZeh\"><br/></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-kbXUQ1ae\" id=\"h346b9f0-kbXUQ1ae\">应用申请账户授权</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-caEJbLMK\">本地推业务接口允许工作台（旧版巨量引擎工作台，账户角色CUSTOMER_OPERATOR 旧版巨量引擎工作台协作者、CUSTOMER_ADMIN 旧版巨量引擎工作台管理员）以及代理商账户（账户角色PLATFORM_ROLE_LOCAL_AGENT 本地推代理商）授权的业务账号，注意is_valid要为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">true</code> </p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qfu76%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Col%20data-id%3D%5C%22ob7246f7-7li91mBQ%5C%22%20start%3D%5C%221%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-XfnaDkYP%5C%22%3E%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E5%B1%9E%E4%BA%8E%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%3Cstrong%3E%E5%A6%82%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%89%E4%B8%8E%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E6%8E%A8%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E6%89%80%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%97%B6%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E6%83%85%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-RAqg5gZE%5C%22%3E%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%88%86%E5%88%AB%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90Token%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93Token%E4%B8%8E%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F41%2Fdocs%2F1812506522148059%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96Token%E5%B9%B6%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81%E6%95%88%E6%9C%9F%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Fol%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-ERQEopbG%5C%22%3E%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F41%2Fdocs%2F1812506430648330%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-7li91mBQ\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XfnaDkYP\">素材属于敏感物料信息，<strong>如开发者认证使用的主体信息（公司信息）与本地推业务账号所属主体不一致，授权时同时需要申请敏感物料授权</strong>（可参考下方详情流程中的介绍）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RAqg5gZE\">授权页面登录多个账号分别完成授权，需要分别记录对应生成Token，具体Token与授权账户关系介绍可参考：【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/41/docs/1812506522148059\" target=\"_blank\">如何获取Token并维持效期</a>】</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-ERQEopbG\">详细申请授权流程可参考：【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/41/docs/1812506430648330\" target=\"_blank\">如何申请授权</a>】</p></div></div></div></div>",
